    \sum_{i=1}^{k-1} Z_i^2
  }^{-1/2}\!\!
  \sqrt{S_{k-1}}
  + 
  \prn*{
    \sum_{i=1}^{k-1} Z_i^2
  }^{-1}
  \frac{k^3 (k+1)}{24}
  \Mtrue S_{k-1}\\
  &\leq
